15 1 6 14
16 1 7 15
17 1 8 16
18 1 10 17
19 1 9 0
20 1 5 0
21 1 4 0
22 1 7 21
23 1 11 22
24 1 12 0
25 1 13 0

# Extension specification for digital output and input triggers:
# id type channel delay (us) duration (us)
extension TRIGGERS 2
1 1 3 0 10

# Extension specification for setting labels:
# id set labelstring
extension LABELSET 1
1 1 ONCE
2 1 PMC
3 50 LIN
4 0 AVG
5 1 SEG
6 0 REP
7 0 SLC
8 1 NAV
9 0 SEG
10 1 AVG
11 0 LIN
12 0 PMC
13 0 ONCE

